---
/** H06 — BuilderLabTeaser (UN solo bloque en la home): Builder Lab para quien va a lanzar algo nuevo. */
---
<section class="section section--tight" aria-labelledby="lab-teaser-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="lab dark">
      <div class="lab__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--lime">Builder Lab</span>
        <h2 id="lab-teaser-title">¿Vas a lanzar algo nuevo? <span class="text-lime">Empieza aquí.</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">En Builder Lab comparto lo que pruebo, aprendo y construyo, y acompaño a quienes van a lanzar un negocio nuevo, de la idea a las primeras ventas.</p>
        <p class="lab__stages">Construir <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Lanzar <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Crecer</p>
        <a class="btn btn--lime" href="/builder-lab">Conoce Builder Lab <span class="btn__icon" aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="lab__rings" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .lab {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 3rem; align-items: center;
    background: var(--navy-3); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: clamp(2.25rem, 1.5rem + 4vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .lab__copy { max-width: 48rem; }
  .lab__copy .btn { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .lab__stages { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1rem + .5vw, 1.4rem); color: #fff; }
  .lab__stages span { color: var(--lime); margin: 0 .35rem; }
  .lab__rings {
    position: absolute; z-index: -1; width: 520px; aspect-ratio: 1; right: -200px; top: -160px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid #2f5170; opacity: .5;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 70px transparent, 0 0 0 71px #284963, 0 0 0 140px transparent, 0 0 0 141px #22415a;
  }
</style>
